      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KINGSBRAE TED (4) is a handy type who notched his 20th career success when too good (17.11) from Box 1 at this track. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with four wins from four starts. Great chance to get the job done again. DOLLY DAWN (2) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at this track following on from a second place finish (17.61) there the start prior. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Cannot be taken lightly. WATCH HER WIN (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (18.02) at this track in a NG. Safe beginner and drawn well on the inside. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. REMISSION RUN (3) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
